#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.2.md:397
msgid ""
"For DeepSeek-V3.2's Sparse Flash Attention (SFA) backend, when using Decode "
"Context Parallelism (DCP) in PD disaggregation, enable it on both the "
"prefiller and decoder nodes, or disable it on both. Enabling DCP on only one"
" side can cause known accuracy issues."
msgstr ""
"对于DeepSeek-V3.2的稀疏Flash "
"Attention（SFA）后端，在PD分离中使用解码上下文并行（DCP）时，请在预填充节点和解码节点上同时启用或同时禁用。仅在一侧启用DCP可能会导致已知的精度问题。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.2.md:400
msgid ""
"In the standard single-node deployment mode, Prefill (prompt processing) and"
" Decode (token generation) tasks run on the same set of NPUs. PD (Prefill-"
"Decode) separation addresses this by running Prefill and Decode on dedicated"
" node groups, each configured independently:"
msgstr ""
"在标准单节点部署模式下，Prefill（提示处理）和 Decode（令牌生成）任务运行在同一组 NPU 上。PD（Prefill-"
"Decode）分离通过将 Prefill 和 Decode 运行在专用的节点组上来解决此问题，每个节点组独立配置："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.2.md:402
msgid ""
"**Prefill nodes** focus on high-throughput prompt processing, optimized for "
"compute and communication."
msgstr "**Prefill 节点**专注于高吞吐量的提示处理，针对计算和通信进行了优化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.2.md:403
msgid ""
"**Decode nodes** focus on low-latency token generation, optimized for memory"
" bandwidth."
msgstr "**Decode 节点**专注于低延迟的令牌生成，针对内存带宽进行了优化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.2.md:405
msgid ""
"This architecture is recommended for production deployments with concurrent "
"multi-user workloads, where stable latency and high throughput are both "
"required."
msgstr "对于需要同时保证稳定延迟和高吞吐量的并发多用户工作负载的生产部署，推荐使用此架构。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.2.md:407
msgid ""
"We'd like to show the deployment guide of `DeepSeek-V3.2` on multi-node "
"environment with 1P1D for better performance."
msgstr "我们将展示 `DeepSeek-V3.2` 在多节点环境下采用 1P1D 配置以获得更好性能的部署指南。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.2.md:409
msgid ""
"To run the vllm-ascend `Prefill-Decode Disaggregation` service, you need to "
"deploy a `launch_online_dp.py` script and a `run_dp_template.sh` script on "
"each node and deploy a `proxy.sh` script on prefill master node to forward "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"要运行 vllm-ascend 的 `Prefill-Decode 分离`服务，您需要在每个节点上部署 `launch_online_dp.py` "
"脚本和 `run_dp_template.sh` 脚本，并在 prefill 主节点上部署 `proxy.sh` 脚本以转发请求。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V3.2.md:411
msgid ""
"[launch_online_dp.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/external_online_dp/launch_online_dp.py)"
msgstr ""
"[launch_online_dp.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/external_online_dp/launch_online_dp.py)"

